  {
    "description": "Set many messages at once: \`messages\` is \`{ "<locale>": { "<key>": "<value>" } }\`, the same shape as \`x18n apply\`. Files keep their format, key style and order. When a value drops or adds placeholders compared to the source value, nothing is written and \`problems\` lists them (\`applied: false\`); fix the values, or pass \`force: true\`.",
